"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "Xaddidaadaha xawaaraha, xiriirada torrent kasta, soo dejinta iyo beerashada ayaa loo dejiyay torrent kasta markaad ku darto, ama ka dib hoos Torrent Settings. Torrents isticmaalaan proxy ka xiriir tab (HTTP ama SOCKS5, ama Mac ee proxy la \"Use the system settings\") iyo xaddidaadda xawaaraha ee soo dejinta oo dhan.";
"Settings used for every download from a website. A site also covers its subdomains (example.com covers www.example.com). Logins are only sent to that site and are kept with the app's other secrets." = "Settings loo isticmaalo soo dejinta kasta oo ka website. A site sidoo kale waxaa ka mid ah subdomains (example.com waxaa ka mid ah www.example.com). logins waxaa kaliya loo diray in website iyo waxaa la hayaa la app ee sirta kale.";
"A backup holds your settings, site settings, queues and the downloads list. Passwords and cookies are never put in a backup." = "A backup leedahay settings aad, settings site, filaayo iyo soo dejinta liiska. passwords iyo cookies waa marnaba la dhigay in a backup.";
